{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりですヽ(・∀・)ノ\n生駒里奈です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんいかがお過ごしですか〜＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは毎日フル回転しております!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドシングル...\n楽しみにしててくださいね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あといつもコメントありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/29/3294194/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/29/3294194/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのになかなかブログ書かなくてすいません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜日にジャンプ買ったと思ったら...\nもう明日は金曜日よ？\n明後日握手会よ!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのが早すぎる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/29/3294194/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみなさんに会える♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の個別のときは珍しくガーリーだったから次はボーイッシュも取り入れて見ようかしら〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなっ!!\nアドバイスよろしくです(^^ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/29/3294194/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんとのツーショット＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}